        <mxCell id="d_tgt" value="&lt;b&gt;98 rows, each stamped:&#10;  _ods_file_id = F&#10;  _ods_run_id  = 6    ← load run, NOT 2&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#E0F2F1;strokeColor=#00695C;fontFamily=Courier New;fontSize=10;align=left;spacingLeft=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="370" width="280" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="note" value="WHAT JUST HAPPENED&#10;━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━&#10;Load task started → minted pg_write_run_id 6, INSERTED run_log row (pipeline_type='direct_postgres'), orchestrators=[{1, orchestrates}].&#10;Stage postgres_write: start + done = 2 rows in run_stage_log under 6.&#10;98 rows written to ods.&lt;target&gt;. Every row stamped _ods_file_id=F and _ods_run_id=6. (Rule: _ods_run_id = the WRITER, not the ingestion run that produced curated.)&#10;run_log 6 is still 'running' — the finalising writes (lineage, recon, file state, status) happen at step 7." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF4E5;strokeColor=#E65100;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=12;spacingTop=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="340" y="465" width="1320" height="140" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
